## Live Agent CLI Tests and Phone Bridge

- Do not launch a nested `claude`, `claude -p`, `codex`, or similar live agent
  session in the same tmux pane as the active bridged session. This machine runs
  the claude-code-matrix bridge, which keys sessions by tmux pane. A nested
  session in the same pane can deactivate the live session and silently break
  inbound phone-to-terminal routing while outbound messages still appear to work.
- Prefer running live-CLI and end-to-end tests that spawn real agent sessions
  inside a Docker instance, or at minimum in a separate unbridged tmux pane, so
  they cannot disturb the active bridge session.
- If a nested session on this machine is unavoidable and the bridge is disturbed,
  reactivate the real session in `~/.ccmatrix/sessions.json` by setting
  `active: true` and `ended_at: null`, then restart the daemon.

